{"id":61987,"mal_id":61987,"title":"Kusuriya no Hitorigoto 3rd Season","englishTitle":"The Apothecary Diaries Season 3","title_english":"The Apothecary Diaries Season 3","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["The Pharmacist's Monologue","Drugstore Soliloquy"],"en":"The Apothecary Diaries Season 3","ja":"薬屋のひとりごと 第3期"},"synopsis":"In the aftermath of the Shi Clan's rebellion, things have finally settled down, and Maomao has returned to her old life as a pharmacist in the pleasure district. One day, triggered by a breakfast served at the Verdigris House, Maomao senses an anomaly and begins investigating its true nature. Meanwhile, Jinshi, who has revealed his true identity as the Imperial brother and begun to face his heavy responsibilities, is deeply troubled by the final message left by Loulan: a warning of an impending \"disaster that will strike the nation.\" To make matters worse, rumors of a mysterious shrine maiden who deceives the people begin to spread, casting a dark shadow over the country of Li once again. From the depths of the inner court to the city streets, and across foreign borders—the world grows wider, and the stakes even higher for Maomao and Jinshi.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","synopsis_es":"A raíz de la rebelión del Clan Shi, las cosas finalmente se calmaron y Maomao ha regresado a su antigua vida como farmacéutica en el distrito del placer. Un día, provocado por un desayuno servido en Verdigris House, Maomao siente una anomalía y comienza a investigar su verdadera naturaleza. Mientras tanto, Jinshi, que ha revelado su verdadera identidad como hermano imperial y ha comenzado a afrontar sus pesadas responsabilidades, está profundamente preocupado por el mensaje final dejado por Loulan: una advertencia de un inminente \"desastre que golpeará a la nación\". Para empeorar las cosas, los rumores sobre una misteriosa doncella del santuario que engaña a la gente comienzan a extenderse, proyectando una sombra oscura sobre el país de Li una vez más. Desde las 